0 331 216 [
[(separate messages for note on and off:)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 37 702 [
[(Here is a variation on the polyphonic sampler, which can take)]
[(separate messages to start and stop notes \050so that you can attach)]
[(it to a MIDI keyboard, for example.\051 "Note" messages act as before,)]
[(but in an intermediate step they are split onto note-on and)]
[(note-off messages, sent to "onoff". You can alternatively send)]
[(messages straight to "onoff" if you don't know the duration in)]
[(advance.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 37 526 [
[(Messages to "onoff" whose amplitude is zero are note-off messages)]
[(\050the other parameters of note-off messages are ignored\051. The)]
[([sampvoice2] abstraction is a modification of [sampvoice] which)]
[(looks at the amplitude field to decide whether to begin or end a)]
[(note.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 37 446 [
[(To convert "note" messages to pairs of "onoff" messages, first a)]
[(counter generates a tag. The [pipe] object delays a copy of the)]
[(tag, which the following [pack] object converts into a note-off)]
[(message \050a pair of numbers, the tag and a zero.\051)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 37 380 [
[(Under [r onoff], the [poly] object allocates a voice number,)]
[(putting it out paired with velocity. After swapping the two and)]
[(packing them into a single message, the amplitude is checked)]
[(against zero by the [route 0] object. If zero, the "$1 0" message)]
[(outputs a list with "voice number" and "0". Otherwise, the "$2")]
[(retrieves the voice number from [poly] which gets packed in with)]
[(the note data and routed to the appropriate [sampvoice2] copy)]
[(inside [clone].)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
